# tenten.vn

> Vietnam's leading domain registrar and web infrastructure provider. Official VNNIC-accredited registrar for .VN domains and ICANN-accredited international domain registrar. Founded in 2005, operating under GMO-Z.com RUNSYSTEM JSC (part of GMO Internet Group, Japan). Serves individuals, SMEs, and enterprises across Vietnam with domain registration, web hosting, email server, cloud VPS, SSL certificates, and AI-powered tools. Headquartered in Hanoi, with offices in Ho Chi Minh City and Tokyo.

