- [.VN Domain](https://tenten.vn/vi/ten-mien/ten-mien-vn): Register Vietnam's national domain extension (.VN), legally protected under Vietnamese law. Tenten.vn is the top-ranked VNNIC registrar by new domain growth in 2024.
- [Domain Pricing](https://tenten.vn/vi/bang-gia-ten-mien): Full pricing table for all domain extensions. .VN from 550,000 VND/year; .COM from 309,000 VND/year; specialty extensions from 28,000 VND/year.
- [Transfer Domain to Tenten](https://tenten.vn/vi/chuyen-doi-nha-cung-cap-ten-mien): Move existing domains from any registrar to Tenten with no downtime.
- [Domain Marketplace](https://tenten.vn/vi/DomainSell/index): Buy and sell premium domains through Tenten's marketplace.
- [Free .id.vn Domain](https://tenten.vn/vi/ten-mien/id-vn): Free .id.vn subdomain for personal websites and portfolios.
- [Free .biz.vn Domain](https://tenten.vn/vi/ten-mien/biz-vn): Free .biz.vn subdomain for small business web presence.
- [Ministry of Industry & Trade Website Notification](https://tenten.vn/vi/dich-vu/dang-ky-web-site-bo-cong-thuong): Mandatory registration service for e-commerce websites operating in Vietnam.
